WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.820
A strong position lines up three truths:

00:00:02.870 --> 00:00:03.799
a brand belief,

00:00:03.849 --> 00:00:04.801
an audience truth and a product truth,

00:00:04.851 --> 00:00:07.642
all saying the same thing.

00:00:08.333 --> 00:00:09.509
Take KitKat.

00:00:09.559 --> 00:00:12.410
At three o'clock an office worker feels the drag.

00:00:12.460 --> 00:00:13.991
Everyone needs a break.

00:00:14.041 --> 00:00:16.195
That's the audience truth.

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:17.700
And the bar is made to be broken, two fingers that snap apart.

00:00:17.089 --> 00:00:23.754
The product proves the belief: breaks are good.

00:00:24.467 --> 00:00:27.613
Have a break, have a KitKat says all three at once.

00:00:27.663 --> 00:00:31.889
So find each truth, and fix whichever one is missing.
